# Applicant-portal uploads: admissions documents (ID scans, certificates)
# and application-fee payment proofs. More sensitive than the logo/profile
# uploads already tracked elsewhere under public/assets/uploads/, so these
# stay local/on-server only rather than going into git history.
/public/assets/uploads/admissions
/public/assets/uploads/application_payments



